OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and mainly dry start but
OL,6,Fsome early showers in far south. A few
OL,7,Fsunny intervals mid-morning, then
OL,8,Fturning cloudy again with some showers
OL,9,Freturning from around lunchtime.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few showers at first but
OL,12,Fthese gradually clearing to allow some
OL,13,Fclear spells. Cloudy again in the east
OL,14,Ffrom late evening with some showers,
OL,15,Fstaying dry in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
