OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRather cloudy in the east with
OL,6,Fsome light showers at first, then dry
OL,7,Fwith some bright spells developing
OL,8,Flater. Bright at first in the
OL,9,Fsouthwest, cloudier later with some
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FSaturday dry with some sunshine.
OL,14,FCloudier on Sunday with a few showers.
OL,15,FDry with bright or sunny spells on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
